  "evidencia": "Page: Christian Whitehead. Sentence: He is most recognised for his work creating updated ports of early games in Sega's \"Sonic the Hedgehog\" series, as well as being the project lead of an original title in the series, titled \"Sonic Mania\".\nPage: Sonic Mania. Sentence: Sonic Mania is a side-scrolling platform game developed by PagodaWest Games and Headcannon and published by Sega for Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4, Xbox One, and Microsoft Windows.\nPage: Retro Engine. Sentence: Retro Engine is a game engine developed by Australian programmer Christian \"Taxman\" Whitehead, best known for its use by Sega for games in the \"Sonic the Hedgehog\" series.",
