        "original_id": "332bcf3c-1000-568f-98f7-86b375d01406",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christian Whitehead\n- Products: Sonic Mania, Retro Engine\n- Companies: Sega, PagodaWest Games, Headcannon\n- Topics: Sonic the Hedgehog series\n\nFacts:\n- Christian Whitehead is most recognized for creating updated ports of early games in Sega's Sonic the Hedgehog series.\n- Retro Engine is a game engine developed by Australian programmer Christian \"Taxman\" Whitehead.\n- Retro Engine is best known for its use by Sega for games in the Sonic the Hedgehog series.\n- Christian Whitehead was the project lead of Sonic Mania, an original title in the Sonic the Hedgehog series.\n- Sonic Mania is a side-scrolling platform game developed by PagodaWest Games and Headcannon.\n- Sega published Sonic Mania for Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4, Xbox One, and Microsoft Windows.",
